# A dummy verify session on Windows (its HOME is redirected) leaves PowerShell's module cache, Microsoft/Windows/PowerShell/ModuleAnalysisCache, in the working
# directory of the server (the checkout root) and of its terminals. Only that root-level folder is ignored.
/Microsoft/
